# Guidelines for Educational Priorities and Curricular Innovations in the Areas of Human and Medical Genetics

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
Eleven guidelines are listed along with rationales. Considerations for the implementation of those guidelines, including content, target populations, delivery systems, and evaluation, are also included. The structure and functions of The Center for Education in Human and Medical Genetics are illustrated and discussed. (MA)

